#: webshop/webshop/doctype/webshop_settings/webshop_settings.json
msgid ""
"<p>The sitemap is automatically generated and cached for 6 hours. You can "
"access it at:</p><ul><li><a href=\"/sitemap_index.xml\" "
"target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_index.xml</a> - Main sitemap index</li><li><a "
"href=\"/sitemap.xml\" target=\"_blank\">/sitemap.xml</a> - All "
"content</li><li><a href=\"/sitemap_products.xml\" "
"target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_products.xml</a> - Products only</li><li><a "
"href=\"/sitemap_categories.xml\" "
"target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_categories.xml</a> - Categories only</li><li><a "
"href=\"/sitemap_brands.xml\" target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_brands.xml</a> - "
"Brands only</li><li><a href=\"/sitemap_blog.xml\" "
"target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_blog.xml</a> - Blog posts only</li><li><a "
"href=\"/sitemap_pages.xml\" target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_pages.xml</a> - Pages"
" only</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Le sitemap est généré automatiquement et mis en cache pendant 6 heures. "
"Vous pouvez y accéder à :</p><ul><li><a href=\"/sitemap_index.xml\" "
"target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_index.xml</a> - Index principal du "
"sitemap</li><li><a href=\"/sitemap.xml\" target=\"_blank\">/sitemap.xml</a> "
"- Tout le contenu</li><li><a href=\"/sitemap_products.xml\" "
"target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_products.xml</a> - Produits uniquement</li><li><a"
" href=\"/sitemap_categories.xml\" "
"target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_categories.xml</a> - Catégories "
"uniquement</li><li><a href=\"/sitemap_brands.xml\" "
"target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_brands.xml</a> - Marques uniquement</li><li><a "
"href=\"/sitemap_blog.xml\" target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_blog.xml</a> - "
"Articles de blog uniquement</li><li><a href=\"/sitemap_pages.xml\" "
"target=\"_blank\">/sitemap_pages.xml</a> - Pages uniquement</li></ul>"

